WEBVTT

1
00:00:13,620 --> 00:00:14,620
what are you going to do

2
00:00:14,820 --> 00:00:19,190
Hello everyone, I am Wang Tianwei

3
00:00:19,490 --> 00:00:22,960
I heard what you said

4
00:00:23,260 --> 00:00:24,960
Students just want to get to know each other

5
00:00:24,960 --> 00:00:28,310
make friends hello

6
00:00:28,940 --> 00:00:30,740
We don't seem to be in the same class

7
00:00:31,040 --> 00:00:35,470
Yes, I am from Class S and you are from Class A. Zhang is here.

8
00:00:35,570 --> 00:00:38,970
I just came to say hello. Don't be afraid. It's okay.

9
00:00:39,170 --> 00:00:40,170
I'm leaving

10
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:44,880
I'm getting ready to leave too. Do you want to come with us? No.

11
00:00:49,100 --> 00:00:52,000
Your voice seems a little hoarse. Is it because you have a cold?

12
00:00:52,200 --> 00:00:53,300
I have cold medicine here

13
00:00:53,300 --> 00:00:54,200
do you want to eat some
